{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2636","id":4710447992,"node_id":"PR_kwDOACGs6c8AAAABGMO7eA","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2636","diff_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2636.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2636.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2636","number":2636,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: increment inspector port for IPv6 hosts","user":{"login":"20ns","id":185199662,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwnsLg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185199662?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns","html_url":"https://github.com/20ns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20ns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Commander increments the Node inspector port when spawning an executable subcommand, but the host patterns exclude colons. Bracketed IPv6 hosts therefore bypass the incrementer, and the child tries to use the parent's port.\n\nFor example, running `node --inspect=[::1]:19340 tests/fixtures/inspect.js sub` on `develop` prints `Starting inspector on ::1:19340 failed: address already in use`. With this fix, the child starts its inspector on `[::1]:19341`.\n\nRecognise bracketed IPv6 hosts in the existing shared parser, both with an explicit port and with the default port. Add separate regressions for IPv6 hosts with and without an explicit port using the existing executable-subcommand test helper. No dependencies or API changes.\n\nValidation:\n- The regression fails before the fix and passes afterward.\n- All 1,427 runtime tests and TypeScript tests pass on Node 22.22.0, 24.21.0, and 26.10.0.\n- `pnpm check` passes, including JavaScript and TypeScript checks, ESLint, and Prettier.\n- The real parent/child reproduction opens separate IPv6 inspector ports after the fix.\n- Checked all four supported inspector flags with IPv6, IPv4, hostname, default-port, and port-zero inputs.\n\nSuggested changelog entry: Fix incrementing the Node inspector port for IPv6 hosts when spawning executable subcommands.\n\nPrepared with AI assistance. The complete diff was reviewed and the checks above were run before submission.\n","created_at":"2026-10-01T22:35:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T03:28:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-05T03:25:59Z","merged_at":"2026-10-05T03:25:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"6320660fcbced18d458eac165f992440d45a1ae2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":1418520456,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE4NTIwNDU2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/labels/pending%20release","name":"pending release","color":"a7f9b6","default":false,"description":"Merged into a branch for a future release, but not released yet","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2636/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2636/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2636/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/statuses/95276cf099137cb5d07ad933b141115f09734360","head":{"label":"20ns:fix/ipv6-inspector-port","ref":"fix/ipv6-inspector-port","sha":"95276cf099137cb5d07ad933b141115f0973436